        "id": "electro",
        "name": "Hakushin Ring · electro",
        "source": "Weapon",
        "category": "weapon",
        "defaultEnabled": true,
        "description": "After the character equipped with this weapon triggers an Electro elemental reaction, nearby party members of an Elemental Type involved in the elemental reaction receive a 10%/12.5%/15%/17.5%/20% Elemental DMG Bonus for their element, lasting 6s. Elemental Bonuses gained in this way cannot be stacked. Combat snapshot: set the controls for this hit; durations, stack consumption, healing, energy and cooldowns are not simulated.",
